{"id":"56ea983120112160","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-coverdominance.md","title":"Dominated column removal preserves a minimum cover","display":"thm-coverdominance — Dominated column removal preserves a minimum cover","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-coverdominance","aliases":["27-thm-coverdominance"],"display":"thm-coverdominance — Dominated column removal preserves a minimum cover","depends_on":["[[27-df-covermatrix]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§3.3.2 Simplification S4","source_printed_pages":"150","source_pdf_pages":"174","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-coverdominance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-coverdominance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-coverdominance — Dominated column removal preserves a minimum cover"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1dd9f6247717bebe\" href=\"?note=1dd9f6247717bebe\" title=\"27-df-covermatrix\">27-df-covermatrix</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.3.2 Simplification S4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"150"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"174"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,C\">\\(R,C\\)</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle\">\\(A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cov}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cov}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1dd9f6247717bebe\" href=\"?note=1dd9f6247717bebe\" title=\"27-df-covermatrix\">27-df-covermatrix</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in C\">\\(i,j\\in C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ne j\">\\(i\\ne j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(r,i)\\ge A(r,j)\">\\(A(r,i)\\ge A(r,j)\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in R\">\\(r\\in R\\)</span> 成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min_{S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)}|S|=\\min_{S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A):\\,j\\notin S}|S|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min_{S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)}|S|=\\min_{S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A):\\,j\\notin S}|S|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\;\\left((S\\setminus\\{j\\})\\cup\\{i\\}\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\land|(S\\setminus\\{j\\})\\cup\\{i\\}|\\le|S|+1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\;\\left((S\\setminus\\{j\\})\\cup\\{i\\}\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\land|(S\\setminus\\{j\\})\\cup\\{i\\}|\\le|S|+1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\;(j\\in S\\Rightarrow|(S\\setminus\\{j\\})\\cup\\{i\\}|\\le|S|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\;(j\\in S\\Rightarrow|(S\\setminus\\{j\\})\\cup\\{i\\}|\\le|S|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若最小覆盖用了被支配列 j，就以覆盖范围更大的列 i 代替它，项数不增。故可删 j 而保留至少一个项数最小解，但某些其他极小覆盖会丢失。对带权目标，只有在支配列权重不大于被支配列时才有对应保证；本页明确只断言项数目标。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-covermatrix","status":"resolved","id":"1dd9f6247717bebe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-covermatrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-covermatrix","status":"resolved","id":"1dd9f6247717bebe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R,C$ 为有限集，$a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle$，$\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\ne\\varnothing$；$\\mathrm{Cov}$ 见 [[27-df-covermatrix]]。$i,j\\in C$，$i\\ne j$，且 $A(r,i)\\ge A(r,j)$ 对所有 $r\\in R$ 成立。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R,C","display":false},{"tex":"a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cov}","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ne j","display":false},{"tex":"A(r,i)\\ge A(r,j)","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\min_{S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)}|S|=\\min_{S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A):\\,j\\notin S}|S|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\;\\left((S\\setminus\\{j\\})\\cup\\{i\\}\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\land|(S\\setminus\\{j\\})\\cup\\{i\\}|\\le|S|+1\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall S\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)\\;(j\\in S\\Rightarrow|(S\\setminus\\{j\\})\\cup\\{i\\}|\\le|S|).","display":true}],"bytes":1711,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-coverdominance|thm-coverdominance — Dominated column removal preserves a minimum cover]]"}],"outgoing":["1dd9f6247717bebe"]}